Async Alembic migrations for Sales Insight.

Generate the first migration once your database is running and .env is set:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "init"
    alembic upgrade head

The database URL is read from src.config (DATABASE_URL) in env.py, and the
target metadata is SQLModel.metadata, so autogenerate sees every model in
src/db/models.py.
